photocraft (0.23.1+dfsg-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  [ Dimitry Ishenko ]
  * Add Debian packaging
  * Remove ArtCraft trademarked files

  [ Dylan M. Taylor ]
  * Merge tested main for v0.23.1
  * Fix Flatpak updates and bump to 0.23.1 (#13322)
  * paint: two stroke tests check the result the stroke now returns
  * paint: refuse a sequential-dab stroke whose working copy is too
    large (#11070)
  * Engine: check dense working buffers against a budget before
    expanding sparse content (#10964)
  * Actions: charge skipped steps to the playback budget, bound batch
    nesting, clip the set override (#10969)
  * fix(engine): authorization for nested scratch sessions and preset
    calls, CSV and PostScript text escaping (#11188)
  * fix(engine): bound sparse remap, scaled clone sources, path reads,
    export format, name lookups (#11181)
  * fix(codecs): checked sizes in encoders, EXR name lookup, FITS float
    limit, VP8 plane copies, EXIF thumbnail bytes (#11164)
  * fix(format,engine): limit zstd windows, set bundle modes via the
    handle, refuse symlinked presets (#11145)
  * fix(io): charge importers for the whole tiles surfaces keep (#11144)
  * fix(gpu): cap plan accumulator slots and gradient lookup tables
    (#11061)
  * codecs: list each Cryptomatte layer once and index streams by name
    (#10978)
  * fix(algo): bound EXIF text decoding, warp scans, gallery windows,
    inpaint sizes, pyramid depth (#11161)
  * fix(algo): hold raw filter parameters to their ranges (Water Paper,
    Box Blur, Lanczos, Camera Raw noise) (#11199)
  * fix(ui-egui): bound the RAW re-read and treat symlinked names as
    taken in batch export (#11204)
  * Save: a replacement in another group does not widen group access
    (#11232)
  * fix(cms): charge decoded CLUT values against a per-profile budget
    (#11055)
  * Camera Raw: read each source row once when building the preview
    proxy (#11064)
  * fix(compose): bisect gradient stops, evict oversized effect maps,
    skip empty distance transforms (#11056)
  * fix(engine): apply the metadata choice to WebP Quick Export (#11058)
  * text: charge the rasterizer's output tiles, not only its pixels
    (#11047)
  * Escape control characters in log lines and diagnostic output taken
    from files and plug-ins (#11218)
  * automation: save_bytes never reads linked files (#11233)
  * Place: refuse a scale that makes the placed image exceed the render
    pixel limit (#11229)
  * macOS signing: decode the certificate into an exclusive temp file
    (#11028)
  * ci: use StepSecurity's maintained actions (#13337)
  * Merge pull request #13281 from storytold/chore/craft-update-6e03f65
  * Updates: take craft-update from craft-libs main at 6e03f65bf

